```Title: .NET Profiler Environment Variable Set (COR_PROFILER) (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1574.012 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: e3dbcb3a-3a16-45a9-a4a9-7daf06d09d9a```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 13 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: APM and profiling agents (Dynatrace, AppDynamics, New Relic, Datadog) that register a .NET profiler```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=13
(TargetObject IN ("*\\COR_ENABLE_PROFILING", "*\\COR_PROFILER", "*\\COR_PROFILER_PATH", "*\\CORECLR_ENABLE_PROFILING", "*\\CORECLR_PROFILER", "*\\CORECLR_PROFILER_PATH"))
| table _time host User Image EventType TargetObject Details
